# Spotter UI kit

Before adding or redesigning UI in `src/pages` / `src/components`, follow the living kit at
`/app/admin/ui` (`src/pages/UiKitPage.tsx`) and tokens in `src/styles/global.css` +
`src/styles/sheets.css`.

## Must follow

1. **One primary action per section.** Default `.btn` is 48px. Secondary block actions use
   `.btn-sm` (40px) and/or `.btn-soft` / `.btn-ghost`. Do not stack many full-size ghost blocks.
2. **Secondary screens:** wrap back + title in `.subpage-top` (14px gap). Do not combine
   `.back-link { margin-bottom: 14px }` with an extra page grid gap between the same elements.
   Workouts IA: list is the hub (`goWorkoutsHub` / replace). Hub exits to Home (`exitWorkoutsSection`
   / replace, label «Мой зал»). Never `navigate(-1)` from the list and never push `/app/workouts`
   on top of progress or a session.
3. **Section headings:** only `SectionTitle` / `.section-title` — no one-off `h2` font sizes for
   the same role. Fonts: Unbounded = headlines (page 1.4375rem / 800, section 1.05rem / 700),
   Syne = SPOTTER wordmark only, Manrope = UI/body. Kickers and labels are sentence case —
   no `uppercase` and no letter-spacing 0.04–0.10em. Full specimen lives on the UI kit
   «Типографика» block.
4. **SectionTitle actions:** use `.section-action` for Link and `<button>` (“Кого я лайкнул”,
   “Добавить”, “Изменить”). Same Manrope muted look — no `.text-link` / font-weight 650 in the
   action slot. Non-click meta → `.muted` / `.dim`. Admin accent nav links may keep `.text-link`
   outside SectionTitle.
5. **Section entry links:** use `.entry-tools` + `.entry-link` for frequent product tools outside
   bottom-nav (Home: workouts, activity). Support feedback → Settings “Поддержка” as
   `btn btn-ghost btn-block` (not entry-link). Admin → Profile bottom `btn-ghost` (admins only).
   Contextual help (request gym) → soft/ghost `btn-sm` next to the empty task.
6. **Feedback:** `MomentFX` only for check-in / check-out / rare celebration. Routine success
   (like, copy, share) → `SoftFlash`.
7. **Bottom sheets:** compose `.app-sheet`, `.app-sheet-backdrop`, `.app-sheet-panel`,
   `.app-sheet-grab` + `useSheetA11y`. Do not invent another backdrop/panel copy-paste.
8. **Empty states:** `.empty-copy` + `.empty-copy-title` + `.empty-copy-lead` + one primary CTA;
   extra CTA → `btn-sm`. Never show empty while the region is still loading.
9. **Loaders:** before adding a spinner anywhere, follow the UI kit «Лоадер» block. Use only
   `SoftLoader` in the content slot that will be filled (min-height ~120px). Keep header, tabs,
   and the primary CTA mounted and still. Delay the ring 280–400ms unless the parent already
   waited (`useGymPeople` 1s → `delayMs={0}`). Use `SOFT_LOADER_DELAY_MS` (320). One loader per
   region. Button busy = label («Сохраняем…»), not a second spinner. Do not invent CSS rings or
   skeletons.
10. **List rows with multiple actions:** primary navigation on the left; secondary (copy/expand)
   as separate targets — see workout history pattern on UiKit page.
11. **Profile edit:** Settings via header gear; do not add a second full-width “Редактировать
   профиль” CTA wall. Feedback lives in Settings; admin contour button only for `isAdmin`.
12. **Segmented control:** exclusive view switch (2–4 options) uses `.seg` + `.seg-item` +
    `.is-active`. Compact period row adds `.seg--fit`. Do not invent a local tab recipe
    (liked-tabs, activity-range-btn, workout-progress-mode). Not chips (multi-filter) and not
    `.toggle` / `.toggle-row` (on/off). Live: Progress, Likes, Activity period. Specimen: UI kit
    «Сегмент».

